    "summary": "Each time this unit gets **selected to fight** in the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), you may make a [psychic roll](vsdata:core-rule/psychic-abilities) (1 D6) for it if it isn't **[battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)**. If you do:\n\n- A 1 makes this unit battle-shocked.\n- For the rest of that phase, its melee attacks gain **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)** and **[[PSYCHIC]](vsdata:weapon-ability/psychic)**.",
